#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize the service in an untrusted environment {#initialize-the-service-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr "Inizializzare il servizio in un ambiente non attendibile {#initialize-the-service-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these instructions if you are working with IBM Cloud or the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API in an untrusted environment, such as a public computer.\n"
msgstr "Segui queste istruzioni se stai lavorando con IBM Cloud o con l'API REST IBM Quantum Compute Service in un ambiente non attendibile, come un computer pubblico.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Avoid executing code on an untrusted machine or an external cloud Python environment to minimize security risks.** If you must use an untrusted environment (on, for example, a shared or public computer), change your API key after each use by deleting it on the [API keys page](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) and creating a new one.\n"
msgstr "**Evita di eseguire codice su una macchina non attendibile o in un ambiente Python cloud esterno per ridurre al minimo i rischi di sicurezza.** Se devi utilizzare un ambiente non attendibile (ad esempio su un computer condiviso o pubblico), cambia la tua chiave API dopo ogni utilizzo eliminandola dalla [pagina delle chiavi API](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) e creandone una nuova.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Protect your API key!** Never include your key in source code, Python script, or notebook file. When sharing code with others, ensure that your API key is not embedded directly within the Python script. Instead, share the script without the token and provide instructions for securely setting it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"      **Proteggi la tua chiave API!** Non includere mai la tua chiave nel codice sorgente, negli script Python o nei file notebook. Quando condividi codice con altri, assicurati che la tua chiave API non sia incorporata direttamente nello script Python. Condividi invece lo script senza il token e fornisci istruzioni per configurarlo in modo sicuro.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      If you accidentally share your key with someone or include it in version control like Git, immediately revoke your key by following the [Deleting an API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) instructions on IBM Cloud.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"      Se condividi accidentalmente la tua chiave con qualcuno o la includi in un sistema di controllo versione come Git, revoca immediatamente la tua chiave seguendo le istruzioni [Eliminazione di una chiave API](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) su IBM Cloud.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Trova le tue credenziali di accesso {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key (also referred to as an  _API token_). From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. The token will not be visible again. Note that you can use a single API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Trova la tua chiave API (chiamata anche _token API_). Dal [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), crea la tua chiave API, quindi copiala in una posizione sicura in modo da poterla usare per l'autenticazione. Il token non sarà più visibile in seguito. Nota che puoi usare una singola chiave API per connetterti a qualsiasi regione.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Facoltativo: trova l'istanza che desideri utilizzare dalla pagina [Istanze](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Passa il cursore sul relativo CRN, fai clic sull'icona per copiarlo, quindi salvalo in una posizione sicura in modo da poterlo usare per identificare l'istanza.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to IBM Cloud in an untrusted environment {#authenticate-to-ibm-cloud-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr "Autenticati a IBM Cloud in un ambiente non attendibile {#authenticate-to-ibm-cloud-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To initialize the service in this situation, use code like the following:\n"
msgstr "Per inizializzare il servizio in questa situazione, usa un codice simile al seguente:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # The credentials you enter will override any saved\n"
"    # account credentials that might be available locally.\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(\n"
"      # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from\n"
"      # the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard, and then delete\n"
"      # the key on the API keys page after entering this code:\n"
"      token=\"<your-API-key>\", \n"
msgstr ""
"    # The credentials you enter will override any saved\n"
"    # account credentials that might be available locally.\n"
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(\n"
"      # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved from\n"
"      # the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard, and then delete\n"
"      # the key on the API keys page after entering this code:\n"
"      token=\"<your-API-key>\",\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      # Optionally specify an instance to use\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\"\n"
"      )\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      # Optionally specify an instance to use\n"
"      instance=\"<IBM Cloud CRN or instance name>\"\n"
"      )\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"rest-untrusted\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"rest-untrusted\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to the REST API in an untrusted environment {#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment}"
msgstr "Autenticati all'API REST in un ambiente non attendibile {#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to use your API key directly to authenticate to the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API, where `<your_API_KEY>` is the 44-character API key you created and saved from your IBM Quantum Platform dashboard.\n"
msgstr "Segui questi passaggi per utilizzare la tua chiave API direttamente per autenticarti all'API REST di IBM Quantum Compute Service, dove `<your_API_KEY>` è la chiave API a 44 caratteri che hai creato e salvato dalla dashboard di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use your API key to generate a [bearer token](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest#authentication). A _bearer token_ is a temporary credential that expires after no more than one hour. After the acquired token expires, you must generate a new one to continue calling IBM Cloud or other service APIs. :\n"
msgstr "Usa la tua chiave API per generare un [bearer token](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest#authentication). Un _bearer token_ è una credenziale temporanea che scade dopo al massimo un'ora. Una volta scaduto il token, devi generarne uno nuovo per continuare a chiamare IBM Cloud o le altre API dei servizi. :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "    ```bash\n"
#| "    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
#| "    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
#| "    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
#| "    ```\n"
#| "    Copy and save the returned bearer token:  `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
#| "  1. Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN and bearer token in the request's headers.\n"
msgid ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Copy and save the returned bearer token:  `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
"  1. Authenticate requests to the IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API by including the CRN and bearer token in the request's headers.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```bash\n"
"    curl -X POST 'https://iam.cloud.ibm.com/identity/token' \\\n"
"    -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded' \\\n"
"    -d 'grant_type=urn:ibm:params:oauth:grant-type:apikey&apikey=your_API_KEY'\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Copia e salva il bearer token restituito: `\"access_token\": \"<NEW_BEARER_TOKEN>\"`\n"
"  1. Autentica le richieste all'API REST di Qiskit Runtime includendo il CRN e il bearer token negli header della richiesta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      curl -X 'GET' \\\n"
"        'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/usage' \\\n"
"        '-H accept: application/json' \\\n"
"        '-H authorization: Bearer <BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"        '-H Service-CRN: <INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"      ```\n"
msgstr ""
"      ```bash\n"
"      curl -X 'GET' \\\n"
"        'https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/api/v1/usage' \\\n"
"        '-H accept: application/json' \\\n"
"        '-H authorization: Bearer <BEARER_TOKEN>' \\\n"
"        '-H Service-CRN: <INSTANCE_CRN>'\n"
"      ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change your API key after each use by [Deleting your existing API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) and generating a new API key on the [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) home page.\n"
msgstr "Cambia la tua chiave API dopo ogni utilizzo [eliminando la tua chiave API esistente](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-userapikey&interface=ui#delete_user_key) e generando una nuova chiave API nella home page di [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/).\n"

